---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Services
eyebrow: Services
lede: Permits, licenses, billing, collection schedules, and how to report a problem.
tags: []
breadcrumbs: []
---

{% include "partials/page-header.njk" %}

<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10">
  <section>
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold">Most requested</h2>
    <ul class="mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% set featured = [
        { label: "Pay a utility bill", url: "/services/utility-billing/", note: "Rates, due dates, and payment options" },
        { label: "Apply for a permit", url: "/services/permit-application/", note: "Start a residential building permit" },
        { label: "Trash & recycling", url: "/services/trash-recycling/", note: "Collection days and what goes where" },
        { label: "Report an issue", url: "/services/report-an-issue/", note: "Potholes, drainage, code violations" },
        { label: "Business license", url: "/services/business-licenses/", note: "New applications and renewals" },
        { label: "Records request", url: "/services/records-requests/", note: "Ask for a town record" }
      ] %}
      {% for item in featured %}
        <li>
          <a
            href="{{ item.url }}"
            class="flex h-full flex-col rounded border border-navy-100 p-5 no-underline transition hover:border-bay-500 hover:bg-bay-50"
          >
            <span class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">{{ item.label }}</span>
            <span class="mt-1 text-sm text-navy-700">{{ item.note }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold">All services</h2>
    <ul class="mt-5 divide-y divide-navy-100 border-y border-navy-100">
      {% for service in collections.services %}
        <li class="py-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">
            <a href="{{ service.url }}" class="text-bay-700 no-underline hover:underline"
              >{{ service.data.title }}</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-navy-700">{{ service.data.lede }}</p>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
      <li class="py-4">
        <h3 class="font-semibold">
          <a href="/services/permit-application/" class="text-bay-700 no-underline hover:underline"
            >Apply for a Permit</a
          >
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-navy-700">
          Start a residential building permit application.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="rounded border border-navy-100 bg-navy-50 p-6">
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold">In person at Town Hall</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-navy-700">
        {{ site.address.line2 }}, {{ site.address.city }}, {{ site.address.state }}
        {{ site.address.zip }}
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-navy-700">{{ site.hours }}</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-navy-700">{{ site.phone }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded border border-navy-100 bg-navy-50 p-6">
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold">Handled by the county, not the town</h2>
      <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-navy-700">
        <li>Deeds, mortgages, and recorded plats (County Clerk)</li>
        <li>Animal control and licensing complaints</li>
        <li>Household hazardous waste drop-off</li>
        <li>Court records and jury service</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-navy-500">
        Property tax assessment and vital records for events in Osprey Point are
        handled here in Town Hall, not at the county.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
